<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you for your inquiry into the M.S. in the Science of Health Care Delivery at Arizona State University.&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">As the health care industry continues its rapid expansion, ASU's School for the Science of Health Care Delivery is helping students gain a competitive advantage in the field.</span><span style="font-family: arial;">&nbsp;Graduates of our program will acquire real-world experience in exclusive interactive settings, gain unique knowledge from an interdisciplinary curriculum and enjoy opportunities to connect with industry leaders ranging from Mayo Clinic and Banner Health to Mountain Park Health Center and Barrow Neurological Institute.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><span style="font-family: arial;">Take a moment to explore our <a href="https://chs.asu.edu/programs/schools/school-science-health-care-delivery"><font color="#990000">site</font></a> and learn about the scope of our program, our expert faculty members and ASU's exciting new partnership with <a href="https://vimeo.com/154871318"><font color="#990000">Mayo Medical School</font></a>. Please be sure to visit the <font color="#990000"><a href="https://chs.asu.edu/programs/schools/school-science-health-care-delivery/frequently-asked-questions"><font color="#990000">FAQ section</font></a> </font>on our website, as it contains a wealth of information.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial,sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Our admissions committee is happy to accept applications for the on-ground option at any time prior to the start of the program in the fall. We also accept applications for our online programs on a rolling basis and students that are accepted may begin at any one of multiple&nbsp;</span></font><font face="Arial,sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">online starts per year.</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Choose from three learning options</b>:</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://chs.asu.edu/programs/science-health-care-delivery-0"><font color="#990000">full-time on-ground program</font></a> (nine months)</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://chs.asu.edu/programs/science-health-care-delivery-0"><font color="#990000">full-time online program</font></a> (15 months)</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://chs.asu.edu/programs/science-health-care-delivery-0"><font color="#990000">part-time online program</font></a> (30 months)</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">With this degree, students can enter such fields as health care delivery and administration, health policy and health system architecture, or use it as a foundation for a career in medicine, pharmacology or as a physician's assistant.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">In the past few years, graduates of the Science of Health Care Delivery program have been admitted to the University of Arizona College of Medicine; University of Arizona College Medicine, Phoenix; Creighton University School of Medicine; Albany Medical School; A.T. Still University School of Osteopathic Medicine, Arizona; Arizona College of Osteopathic Medicine of Midwestern University. Students complete capstone projects at health care sites such as Mayo Clinic, Banner Health and Arizona Department of Health Services.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Applications are still being accepted. <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/majorinfo/ASU00/NHSHCDMS/graduate/false?id=ds-apply"><font color="#990000">Learn more about the Master of Science in the Science of Health Care Delivery program</font></a> and <a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/how-and-when-apply-graduate-admission" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font color="#990000">apply today</font></a><a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/how-and-when-apply-graduate-admission" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">.</a>&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><br></b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Laura Kaufman, M.Ed.</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Assistant Director, Graduate Programs</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffcc33">School for the Science of Health Care Delivery</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#990000">College of Health Solutions - Arizona State University</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">550 North 3rd Street | Phoenix, AZ 85004</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">602-496-0092 | &nbsp;<a href="mailto:laura.kaufman@asu.edu?Subject=Request%20for%20Information">laura.kaufman@asu.edu</a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>